====================================================================================================
3b. EL CHARCO Y LA PLACA DESDE V(t)
====================================================================================================
     modos capilares del charco (disco de radio r, hondo h): f = (1/2pi) sqrt(sigma k^3/rho * tanh(k h)), k = j/r
     r mm   h mm   f(0,1) Hz axial   f(1,1) Hz chapoteo   f(0,2) Hz
      1.0   0.50          542               158              1369
      1.5   0.75          295                87               745
      2.0   1.00          192                57               485
      2.5   1.25          138                41               347
      3.0   1.50          106                32               264
     radio del charco (Rosenthal, placa gruesa, fuente quieta): r = eta V I / (2 pi k (Tm - T0)), eta 0.8, 20 V, 40 A, k 30 W/mK
       placa a   20 C: r = 2.29 mm -> f(0,1) =   157 Hz
       placa a  200 C: r = 2.61 mm -> f(0,1) =   129 Hz
       placa a  400 C: r = 3.09 mm -> f(0,1) =   101 Hz
       placa a  600 C: r = 3.77 mm -> f(0,1) =    75 Hz
     sensibilidad: d ln f / d T0 = -1.5/(Tm - T0) = -0.101 %/K a 20 C -> 1 % de f = 10 K
     patada de una gota de 0.46 mm a 1.0 m/s en charco r=1.5 mm (masa modal 30 %): amplitud ~ 104 um ->  1.04 V (E=10) / 0.114 V (E=1.1)   [orden de magnitud, factor 3]
     patada de una gota de 0.46 mm a 1.0 m/s en charco r=2.0 mm (masa modal 30 %): amplitud ~  67 um ->  0.67 V (E=10) / 0.074 V (E=1.1)   [orden de magnitud, factor 3]
